  "description": "\u201cEqual triangles which are on equal bases and on the same side are also in the same parallels.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 40 (G.69)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 C D E \u27e9, / B C / = / C E /\n00:22 2 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: segment(A, D) \u2192 / A D /\n00:30 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: ? \u00ac(/ A D / \u2225 / B E /) \u2192 parallel_line(A, / B E /) \u2192 / A F / \u2225 / B E /, segment(F, E) \u2192 / F E /\n00:38 4 \u00b7 ASSERT: / B C / = / C E /, / A F / \u2225 / B E / \u2192 \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 F C E \u27e9\n00:52 5 \u00b7 ASSERT: \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 D C E \u27e9, \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 F C E \u27e9 \u2192 \u27e8 D C E \u27e9 = \u27e8 F C E \u27e9 \u21d2\u21d0\n01:05 6 \u00b7 \u2234: / A D / \u2225 / B E /\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.69 \u2022 v2",
